Modifications
-------------
  Added, without altering any pre-existing upstream file except index.js
  (additive static methods only) and index.d.ts (additive type declarations):

    lib/rules/MaskRuleError.js     structured error type with JSON Pointer locations
    lib/rules/RuleSchema.js        declarative schema: kinds, option specs, defaults
    lib/rules/FieldPattern.js      field pattern parser and target collector
    lib/rules/RuleCompiler.js      validation, default resolution, ordering, conflicts
    lib/rules/RuleEngine.js        plan execution, trace, runtime conflict detection
    lib/rules/LegacyMigration.js   maskJSON2 config -> declarative rule set
    tests/testRules.js             rule layer test suite
    tests/testMigration.js         migration equivalence test suite
    examples/                      rule set samples and a runnable demo
    docs/RULES.md                  rule reference
    docs/MIGRATION.md              migration guide

  The pre-existing mask services under lib/maskService/ and the helper module
  lib/helpers/ are unchanged. `maskJSON2` behaviour is unchanged; the upstream
  test suite passes unmodified.

